flowchart TB
    UI[peach-cloud-front] --> REST[peach-scheduler REST]
    REST --> JDBC[(PEACH_SCHEDULER_* canonical JDBC)]
    JDBC --> SM[Spring StateMachine]
    JDBC --> REC[SchedulerReconciler]
    REC --> SPI[SchedulingProvider SPI]
    SPI --> Q[QuartzSchedulingProvider]
    Q --> QDB[(Quartz JDBC QRTZ_*)]
    Q --> BRIDGE[Quartz Trigger Bridge]
    BRIDGE --> OCC[Create JDBC Execution]
    OCC --> DISP[JobDispatcher SPI]
    DISP --> OUTBOX[(Peach Rocket JDBC Outbox)]
    OUTBOX --> MQ[RocketMQ]
    MQ --> EXEC[Business Service Scheduler Consumer]
    EXEC --> CLAIM[Same-Token Claim API]
    CLAIM --> PE[PeachJobExecutor]
    PE --> TP[ThreadPoolManager / SCHEDULED]
    TP --> H[@PeachJob JobHandler]
    H --> RESULT[Result Outbox]
    RESULT --> MQ
    EXT[Future Provider Module] -.->|providerId| .-> SPI
